        "width": "480",
        "height": "235",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "HQ3 · Buttock or back-of-thigh pain: how did it start, and where exactly?\nFIRST: the back must already be cleared (H10) — the spine is a common source of buttock pain.\nASK: “Show me the exact spot. What were you doing when it started?”"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "cNyP7TFyrcoIYVPUoQlMgw:5:740",
