        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "HQ1 · Where does it hurt?\nASK: “Point with one finger to the sorest spot.”\nWATCH: a hand cupped around the side of the hip (the “C-sign”) usually means pain from deep inside the hip joint, even though the hand is on the side."
